{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Cancel a reservation"},"description":"Cancels in two steps. The first mode takes reservation_number and phone_last4, emails a code and returns cancel_id. The second mode takes cancel_id and code, cancels the reservation, releases the room and notifies staff and guest. Automated cancellation is available more than 48 hours before check-in during office hours; other cancellations are handled by the property by phone. Cancellation codes have a separate budget of three per reservation in a rolling 24 hours and, by default, five across the portfolio in a rolling 24 hours, unaffected by booking traffic. The portfolio ceiling is configurable. Unavailable or over-budget cancellations give the property phone without a booking link. The published cancellation policy applies. No payment or refund is processed.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cancel_id":{"description":"Opaque identifier returned by the first step.","maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"code":{"description":"The six-digit code received by the guest by email.","pattern":"^\\d{6}$","type":"string"},"phone_last4":{"description":"Last four digits of the booking contact phone number.","pattern":"^\\d{4}$","type":"string"},"reservation_number":{"description":"Reservation number.","maxLength":100,"type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"name":"cancel_booking","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"booking":{"additionalProperties":false,"anyOf":[{"required":["booking_id","summary","code_expires_at","code_expires_local","code_sent_to","channel","message"]},{"required":["cancel_id","code_expires_at","code_expires_local","code_sent_to","channel","message"]},{"required":["reservation_number","status","property","roomtype","checkin","checkout","total"]}],"properties":{"booking_id":{"type":"string"},"cancel_id":{"type":"string"},"channel":{"const":"email"},"check